10:57:28.590504 [debug]: stmt.execute() (submit+wait_for_completion, returns reader) took 20.432668ms
10:57:28.590648 [debug]: reader.schema() took 1.536µs
10:57:28.590948 [debug]: do_execute(conn) (closure: stmt.execute + schema + batch loop) took 26.344964ms
